pve-s3-manager (0.1.2-1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * S3 Object Storage in the Proxmox VE UI (Datacenter,
    grouped like Permissions): gateways, tenants
    (PVE pools), users & keys, buckets & usage, health.
  * API2 endpoints /cluster/s3 for gateways, users,
    keys, tenants, buckets, objects, versioning,
    lifecycle; keys returned once, never listed.
  * Bucket object browsing and deletion; versioning
    toggle; lifecycle panel rule.
  * Ship pve-s3-bringup/export/health tools and
    HAProxy/keepalived endpoint templates. Package
    Depends pull radosgw, haproxy, keepalived.
